00:48:47.968 --> 00:48:49.678
We... We have an understanding.

486
00:48:50.762 --> 00:48:52.514
- An understanding?
- Yeah.

487
00:48:53.390 --> 00:48:54.391
Dirk, I mean...

488
00:48:55.100 --> 00:48:56.518
you're not even fucking her.

489
