706
01:06:50.049 --> 01:06:51.049
<i>there's one law...</i>

707
01:06:55.054 --> 01:06:56.931
<i>We are food to one another.</i>

708
01:06:58.724 --> 01:06:59.767
<i>Or we are not.</i>

709
01:07:00.601 --> 01:07:02.728
<i>That's it, end of story.</i>

710
01:07:11.278 --> 01:07:12.862
<i>You know how
in late summer</i>

711
